   - "seena" / "seene" = chest
   - "sar" / "sir" / "sear" = head / headache
   - "pait" / "pet" = abdomen / stomach
   - "gala" / "galao" = throat
   - "taang" / "tang" = leg
3. PRESERVE ALL SYMPTOMS & INJURIES:
   - "chot" / "zakhmi" = injury / trauma (DO NOT convert injuries into mere headaches or pain)
   - "pasina" / "paseena" = sweating / diaphoresis
   - "ulti" / "oolti" = vomiting
   - "saans phoolna" = shortness of breath
4. OUTPUT FORMAT: Output ONLY the translated English sentence. Do NOT add preamble, quotes, explanations, or notes.
"""

PARAMETER temperature 0.0
